      {
        "title": "A fixed title stack",
        "detail": "In the top left: 'MINECRAFT' in the game's stone letters, 'HARDCORE' in red with a heart in place of the O, then '100 DAYS' with 'DAYS' in red. It is the same on almost every upload."
      },
      {
        "title": "The setting does the talking",
        "detail": "Apart from the title stack there are no words. The setting is shown: a glass dome under the sea, treehouses in a jungle, red and orange autumn trees, a cave lit by lanterns."
