      {
        "id": "1TVZjvMfwGo",
        "why": "About 167,000 views, 2.6 times the median. The only thumbnail in the sample with a 'DAY 1' and 'DAY 100' split: a player with a yellow duck head on a single block on the left, a large round island base on the right. Showing the start makes the growth visible."
