    "lessons": [
      "For long build videos, show the finished result from above; the hours of work are the selling point.",
      "Keep one title stack in the same corner on every upload so your series is recognised.",
      "Choose settings that are easy to picture (island, underwater, treehouses); here they pulled more than abstract ones like 'in the sky' or 'frozen world', which sat at about 0.4 times the median.",
      "When the start point is extreme (one block), show it next to the result with 'DAY 1' and 'DAY 100'."
